  "body_html": "<h1>sum_split_at</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem sum_split_at [DecidableEq J] (j₀ : J) (f : J → ℝ) : ∑ j : J, f j = f j₀ + ∑ j' : {j : J // j ≠ j₀}, f j'.val</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n</ul>",
